[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/313117201","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3309#issuecomment-313117201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3309","id":313117201,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxMzExNzIwMQ==","user":{"login":"katre","id":326527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjUyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre","html_url":"https://github.com/katre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-05T14:19:49Z","updated_at":"2017-07-05T14:19:49Z","body":"The specific error is that `alias()` rules create an instance of [AliasConfiguredTarget](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/259c9e8014ad960985c0ed99db2a879cdd2ac301/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/rules/AliasConfiguredTarget.java), but `expand_location` requires instances to be [AbstractConfiguredTarget](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/259c9e8014ad960985c0ed99db2a879cdd2ac301/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/analysis/AbstractConfiguredTarget.java) instances.\r\n\r\nThis error message is confusing, because both AbstractConfiguredTarget and AliasConfiguredTarget implement [TransitiveInfoCollection](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/259c9e8014ad960985c0ed99db2a879cdd2ac301/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/analysis/TransitiveInfoCollection.java), which declares that its name is \"Target\".\r\n\r\nThe fix is probably for AliasConfiguredTarget to extend AbstractConfiguredTarget, or for expand_location to relax what it's willing to work with.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/313117201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"katre","id":326527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjUyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre","html_url":"https://github.com/katre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1151002263,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExNTEwMDIyNjM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/1151002263","actor":{"login":"katre","id":326527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjUyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre","html_url":"https://github.com/katre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/following{/other_user}","gis